# Runtime configuration for the Nosana localnet validator.
# Nosana programs are pre-baked in the Docker image — no network access needed.
#
# To clone additional programs at runtime, uncomment and set:
# SOURCE_CLUSTER_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# CLONE_UPGRADEABLE_PROGRAMS=YourProgramId
# CLONE_ACCOUNTS=YourAccountId
